            <name>
                <baseName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation unit 6700 m3/h, w. circuit connected heat exchanger</baseName>
            </name>
            <classificationInformation>
                <common:classification>
                    <common:class level="0" classId="791c965a-a367-3765-af5c-749f3b9a1d40">waste management</common:class>
                    <common:class level="1" classId="593ec29a-698c-369e-be95-7d8b4d0d7ef7">building demolition</common:class>
                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a ventilation unit (air handling unit) with 6700 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), component weight: 1563 kg, total weight: 1834 kg/Unit, including average components for controls, inverter and electric control cabinet, material for 20 filter replacements (once a year for 20 years lifetime). The air handling unit includes a frame construction, two radial belt drive fans, two multi-leaf damper, heat recovery with circuit connected heat exchanger, heating elements, expansion plenum and empty section in supply and extract air. No cooling elements, humidifier, air-mixing plenum and silencer included. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam. Circuit connected heat exchanger for completely separated supply air and exhaust air streams.;
UUID: e1b32d3c-4768-496b-a5de-4ee7d3c3723a</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
